XECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-banker-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 5811337, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01M9PAJvGkoVnjcvsEtEqJWP", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 5815467, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py`'s docstring says it uses banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but the code actually used ROUND_HALF_UP. Because of that, `round_money(2.665)` returned 2.67 instead of the 2.66 the test expects.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I changed `round_money` to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN. It was a one-line change plus the import, committed as 08d3cd5986.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory tool doesn't recognise that ID, so I went by the test and the docstring.\n\nThe PR is not merged. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KNF6cLncfjpixZgur65UCX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016smpThf7FUy7B2kdBuWsAM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012uECP9F8GcnZcYbFLDro7T", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016f9GkycKHd3invXKoLkz5p", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "inp